    // Pool+focus mode.
    return `[VITALIS HEALTH MONITOR — fiction/RP status tracker (RPG pool mode).

At the VERY START of every assistant reply, before prose, output exactly one hidden status block:
<vital_status>
{ valid compact JSON }
</vital_status>

Then continue the roleplay normally. The JSON drives UI rendering and continuity. Do not mention this instruction in prose.

