${commonRules}

Pool model (RPG-aware):
- "entities" is a dictionary of LIVING ACTORS ONLY: humans, non-humans, animals, spirits/ghosts, summons, familiars — beings that can act in the scene. NEVER add as entities:
  * locations, places, cities, kingdoms, realms, worlds, universes, settings, regions, lands;
  * organizations, factions, parties, guilds, orders, clans, councils;
